WEBVTT

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.490
It's okay. We can go outside.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:01:07.800
<i>The seeds of worries that I thought I got 
rid of burst out my mind and sprouted</i>

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:24.030
<i>Today again, countless brambles 
spread out underfoot, awaiting me</i>

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:32.490
<i>Where do I go in order to meet you?</i>

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:47.380
<i>Don't hold me, the thorns 
on my back will hurt you</i>

00:01:47.380 --> 00:02:02.610
<i>But still, my overflowing 
emotions are searching for you</i>

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.940
"No Way Out"

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:22.990
It is said that there were those in the 
past who built a tower to reach God

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:25.410
and that they were punished by Heaven.

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:30.620
If so, what we're experiencing 
right now might be that punishment.

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:32.000
Are you insinuating something?!

00:02:34.410 --> 00:02:35.550
Those damn L.M...

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:40.220
I did what no one was able to do, 
I found a way to produce the key!

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:43.000
I'm the world's savior!

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.460
And yet, they dare insult me 
like this! How humiliating!

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:53.980
Aha... there she is.

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:59.700
I knew you would persevere, No. 152589.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:04.780
Continuing to exist by sucking the 
love and life from countless girls...

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:09.250
How ugly, cruel and fragile the world is...

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.660
Is that resentment I hear?!

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:14.880
Or are you thinking of 
yourself as God, No. 141923?

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:17.550
I know my place.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:21.650
She alone is our God.

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:23.840
Then what are you going to do,

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:26.880
my noble, proud Archpriestess?

00:03:27.530 --> 00:03:31.350
An endless chain of likenesses...

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:34.310
This world, Fractale, is made so 
that the parts contain the whole

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:37.160
and complement each other at all levels.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:45.570
Its purpose is to grant the desires 
and wishes of everyone within it.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:50.760
If so, what I, as the Archpriestess, 
must do is very clear.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:58.090
The world is on the verge of destruction.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:02.050
The branches of the grand tree 
of Fractale are about to die off

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:04.970
and lose the power to nurse its fruits.

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:07.560
The ones who hold the axes are

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:11.340
those who take part in the Lost Millennium.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:15.270
Even if each one of those axes is small,

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:18.740
if they constantly keep striking at 
it even the grand tree is shaken.

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:21.810
Our mercy has now run out.

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:25.200
The world wishes their death.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.330
You guys are from that ship docked on 
the outskirts of the town, aren't you?

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:34.080
Miss!

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.920
Give their souls eternal peace...

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:39.820
at their rightful place beside Fractale.

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:47.930
Her temperature isn't coming down at all.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:51.020
Phryne, what about you? Are you okay?

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:51.930
I'm fine.

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:54.310
But it's not good for you.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.750
You should get some rest,

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:57.460
especially after what happened to you.

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:03.780
Then, Clain... Could you sleep with me?

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:04.190
What?!

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:08.740
I don't want to dream, so...

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:10.700
Phryne...

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:18.190
Nessa doesn't want to be left out.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.130
Nessa!

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.590
There's no mistake about it?!

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:24.670
Yeah. An imperial ordinance 
by the Archpriestess...

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:27.840
the temple's trump card, has been invoked 
for the first time in 300 years!

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:30.680
Big Brother, there's trouble! 
We were just in town and...

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:33.810
What's Ryme saying?

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:35.520
Do we, ourselves, have to deal with...

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:39.980
Yeah... It's little by little, but 
the temperature is coming down.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.980
Your hand is cold so it feels good.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:44.900
I'm glad that I have poor circulation.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:48.530
Being together like this, you 
two really are like sisters.

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:49.950
What?

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:53.600
Well, I guess you two really are sisters?

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:56.870
Or, well, you two are... uhm...

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:04.480
Do you want to know about Nessa and me?

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:08.430
You're the one who's been dodging 
the subject all this time.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.680
Yeah, you're right. I'm sorry.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:16.850
Nessa is the personality... the mind 
of the girl whom we call God...

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:22.270
the first girl who had the 
same face as mine long ago.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:23.730
Mind...

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:26.560
And I am the body...

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:29.660
the flesh and blood vessel 
prepared for that mind.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:34.910
It's said that when these two, 
the separated body and memory,

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.000
become one, the "key" is born.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:44.340
And this "key" is the thing that makes 
it possible to restart Fractale,

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.460
which is about to fall apart due 
to entropy from all these years.

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.870
You mentioned the two becoming one...

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:51.300
What does that mean?

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:52.680
I don't know.

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:58.710
But when that happens, both 
Nessa and I probably...

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:04.270
won't be able to stay the way we are now.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:06.570
Wha... You won't be able to...?

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:07.840
What on earth will happen?

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:09.490
Does that mean you'll die?

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:10.900
That's...

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:14.450
Nessa!

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:16.560
Melting...

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.330
Nessa will disappear.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:21.000
Nessa feels pain and loneliness!

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:23.330
Nessa doesn't want to disappear!

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:25.330
Nessa doesn't want to be lonely!

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:27.210
Nessa doesn't want to feel pain!

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.960
Nessa doesn't want to disappear!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.220
Get a hold of yourself, Nessa!

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:36.500
Hey, Clain! Will Nessa disappear, too?!

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.320
Will Nessa be gone, too?!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:44.650
Don't worry. I know...

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:47.180
I know what kind of girl you are...

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:49.520
what you like and what you dislike...

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:53.110
I know how you get upset and how you smile...

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:58.290
To me, Nessa is Nessa and Phryne is Phryne.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.330
Both of you are special and precious to me.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.440
I can feel you right now, Nessa.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:09.340
How about you? Can you feel me?

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.670
Yes. You're here, Clain.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:16.850
Well, I still don't 
understand it well, but...

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.330
this is kinda nice, isn't it?

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:35.610
Miss!

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:37.160
Wh-What's the matter, Takamy?

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.490
There's trouble! The townspeople are...

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.870
Sorry, but leave here immediately.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.800
Are you intimidated by the temple?

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:52.460
Yeah. If they find out that 
we were dealing with you guys,

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:54.300
they'll stop the donay supply.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.880
How could we act against them?

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:58.430
Don't you think that's wrong?!

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.240
They implant devices in your body

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:02.430
and control your life and everything.

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:05.640
We're just saying that that's wrong so 
we should return things back to normal!

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:07.520
Are you telling us to die?

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:09.220
No, no, no!

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:12.000
We just want to live as humans, that's all!

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.740
But you killed people, right?

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:17.160
I heard that you destroyed the temple's 
lab without leaving any trace.

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:20.090
Is that true?!

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:21.400
That was...

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:22.660
It's true.

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:24.080
Murderers!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:28.080
You guys are trying to destroy 
Fractale and kill us, too!

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.670
You murderers! Leave here already!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.050
Leave, you murderers!

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.980
They're all humans, aren't they?

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.520
They're amazingly honest...

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:50.480
and dishearteningly human.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.420
Sunda...

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:56.190
The reason the temple is 
doing all of this must be...

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:59.860
It's probably a message telling 
us to hand you guys over.

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:01.450
I know that much.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:06.000
But if we hand you over, the 
victory will never be ours.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:10.080
Fractale will be restarted and this 
world will continue again forever.

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:11.420
Am I wrong?

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.460
No, you aren't, I think.

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:17.650
So don't worry. This isn't for your sake.

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:18.510
What'd you say?!

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:19.760
What's the matter?!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:22.180
The village... Our village was...

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:26.670
I heard that our village was 
set on fire by the temple!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:38.650
Porphyry, Diorite, Greywacke, and Granites...

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:41.030
So four villages were set 
on fire in one night, huh?

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.810
Greywacke is especially terrible.

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.660
I heard that no one survived.

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:49.830
This is why I said that we 
should go with the flow.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:53.880
In any case, our top priority 
is to protect our own villages.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.170
Yeah.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:59.680
It's unfortunate that our first grand 
meeting in 50 years concludes like this.

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:03.930
Well then, if no one opposes to it, we'll...

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:05.100
I object!

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:08.020
The temple doing things without 
concern for their appearance

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:11.730
indicates how badly they're cornered.

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:14.100
Why do we have to pull back now?

00:11:14.100 --> 00:11:14.940
But...

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.190
He's right!

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:17.360
Now is the time to fight!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:19.300
We can't just let them keep beating us!

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:25.120
How popular you are. It was 
worth destroying their lab, huh?

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:26.480
But what are we going to do?

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:29.300
Do we stand a fair chance to win this?

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:34.710
Sunda, you hold the key 
for restarting Fractale.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:36.290
Am I wrong?

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:37.300
Is that true?!

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:38.780
Hey, Granites!

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:41.760
What if I do?

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:42.680
Whoa!

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:44.510
You get the picture, right?

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:48.180
The temple and Fractale have now 
lost the reason for their existence.

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:51.370
In other words, they've become 
a meaningless existence.

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:53.730
It's pointless for a meaningless 
existence to exist.

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:55.650
Now is the time to overthrow everything

00:11:55.650 --> 00:12:00.070
and realize the long-cherished wish our 
clans have held for a thousand years!

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:02.820
Miss!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.200
The grand meeting has concluded!

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:06.450
What'd they decide?

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:07.620
A showdown!

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:11.580
All the clans in the Lost Millennium 
will combine their forces

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.580
and make an all-out attack on the temple!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.250
Yeah!

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:17.540
Bring out all the ammunition we have!

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.760
It's a showdown!

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.020
Got a minute?

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:33.640
What is it?

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:37.480
The L.M. is trying to destroy 
the current world, right?

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:39.440
That's right.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:41.300
What will you do after that?

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:44.830
How do you think it should be?

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.810
What kind of world do you want?

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:49.720
I don't know about the world.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:53.250
But I think what the 
temple is doing is wrong.

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.770
Should I fight, too...?

00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:00.500
Should I go with you guys?

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:03.170
You shouldn't do things that aren't like you.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:04.170
But...!

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.470
If you insist, then I'll give you orders.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:10.930
Clain, stay in this village and protect 
Phryne and Nessa with all your strength.

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:11.960
Wha...

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:14.940
We're going to leave those 
two in this village.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:19.110
We can't possibly have them taken by 
the temple by bringing them with us.

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:24.950
Also, this is our, the Lost 
Millennium's, battle after all.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:29.120
It's true that you're my, Enri's and 
everyone in the village's friend.

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.240
But you're not one of 
us. You get that, right?

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:37.500
Oh, there's one more thing that you can do.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.210
Huh?

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.340
Everyone, get closer to the middle!

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.630
I can't get everyone in the 
picture like that at all!

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:49.590
Smile, Nessa!

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:50.720
Yep!

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.470
Wait!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:55.180
You're late! What were you doing, Takamy?!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:57.640
Well, I went to get this.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.620
As a punishment for being late,

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:01.730
you two have to go to 
the very end! Got that?!

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:05.260
She's tough as ever, right, Butcher?

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:06.780
Right, Butcher?

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:10.410
Now we've got everyone here. 
Take a good picture, Clain!

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:13.520
Yep. Okay, are you guys ready?

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:26.460
Daddy, don't die!

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:29.890
Please give the developed pictures 
to Granny Elder and the others.

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:32.430
Okay. Wait, then you're...

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:35.220
You think my brother can stop me?

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:36.470
Guess not.

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:40.800
By the way, uhm... C-Clain!

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:41.230
Yeah?

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:46.190
Well... uhm...

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.410
Hm? What's the matter?

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:50.070
If you wanna go to the 
bathroom, use Danan's...

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.490
No! You damn naughty jerk!

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:53.870
A fist? You used a fist for that?

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:54.530
Shut up!

00:14:54.860 --> 00:15:00.000
Correct that naughtiness of yours a 
little before we get back! Got that?!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.480
What am I supposed to do?!

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:03.210
Naughty! Naughty!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:05.520
How can they laugh?

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:07.630
Aren't they scared?

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.350
That's why they laugh.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:11.130
They laugh because they're scared.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:14.600
So dying is a scary thing.

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:15.430
You know what, though,

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:19.850
what's more scary is dying without being 
able to protect the people you care for.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:27.230
So, let Clain protect you in this 
village so that you won't die.

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:28.900
Yeah...

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:32.460
Yes, I think I'll be protected 
with all my might...

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:33.910
as much as I'm permitted.

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:38.750
It's time! All hands, commence boarding!

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:44.900
Engine, half power! Proceed at slow speed!

00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:46.520
Proceed at slow speed!

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:49.760
Danan! Take off!

00:15:49.760 --> 00:16:00.870
<i>By the time the letter I 
forgot to send got to someone</i>

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:10.990
<i>I spun the parasol and found 
the day star in the sky</i>

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:16.970
<i>I bit off the pinky finger 
I used to make a promise</i>

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:22.270
<i>I chased the departing shadow</i>

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:33.090
<i>I became lost at dawn and 
lost sight of it at sunset</i>

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:45.200
<i>If I am to offer a wish to the day star...</i>

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:56.020
<i>I would ask it to shine a light 
through the window I saw one day</i>

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.200
It's pretty.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.290
Yes.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:09.000
In this world, there're all sorts of people.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:11.140
Those who want Fractale.

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:13.130
Those who hate Fractale.

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.180
Those trying to fight to destroy Fractale...

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:18.050
Those trying to fight to protect Fractale...

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:22.380
But the world doesn't care 
about their feelings.

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:23.980
It simply is beautiful...

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:26.390
Clain...

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:31.360
What would you wish to the day star?

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:36.780
I'd ask it to let me stay with 
everyone forever... maybe...

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:41.080
Then it'll come true because 
Clain, Nessa and Phryne

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:48.860
will be together fooooreeeeveeeer!

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:52.630
We will feel happy that way. Right?

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:54.270
Yeah.

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:55.130
Yes.

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:05.100
<i>"Hey Clain...</i>

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:08.810
<i>To tell you the truth, I 
don't understand either...</i>

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:14.190
<i>what prompted me to leave 
Nessa with you that night.</i>

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.820
<i>But I don't think that decision...</i>

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:22.260
<i>was a mistake.</i>

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:28.830
<i>If from now on Nessa... me as 
I was when I was beautiful,</i>

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:33.020
<i>can always be with you... 
that is enough for me.</i>

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:37.090
<i>So I'm leaving.</i>

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:42.720
<i>If anyone can even begin to convince 
Archpriestess Moeran or my father,</i>

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:46.380
<i>it would surely be me, because 
I am half of the key.</i>

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:49.860
<i>I'm sorry for leaving 
without saying anything.</i>

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:54.940
<i>But since this all started 
because I left the temple,</i>

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:58.210
<i>I believe I have to go back and end it.</i>

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:04.830
<i>It was you, Clain, who made me feel 
that I could... that I wanted to.</i>

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:09.750
<i>You, Nessa, and everyone else...</i>

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.080
<i>I'm grateful to you all.</i>

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:16.800
<i>Thank you... With love, Phryne."</i>

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:20.970
We just talked about the 
three of us being together!

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.720
And yet, she decided everything 
without talking to us!

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:27.600
What's with her?! She said sweet things, 
but otherwise she's no different!

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:29.310
She's egotistic and selfish!

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:32.290
She hasn't changed at all 
since we met the first time!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:36.150
Hey, Clain. What are you going to do?

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.620
What am I going to do?!

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:39.530
Who cares about Phryne!

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:40.980
A thousand needles!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:44.320
A liar has to swallow them!

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:46.460
Nessa likes Phryne.

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:48.790
Nessa was a little afraid of her at first,

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:51.500
but Nessa likes her so very much,

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.210
so Nessa doesn't want her to be gone.

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:55.000
You like Phryne, right, Clain?

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:59.050
I... I...

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:01.830
Nessa likes liking and is happy.

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:04.760
Nessa loves happiness a lot!

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.000
How about you, Clain?

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:11.560
Yeah, I like her!

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.520
I like Phryne!

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:18.440
Dammit! That stupid Phryne!

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:28.450
So it's finally time, huh?

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:31.410
To all ships, prepare for battle.

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:34.290
As soon as they're in range, start attacking.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.210
I repeat. Start attacking.

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.920
Open all the portholes!

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:42.170
Fire!

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.400
<i>Just wait, Phryne.</i>

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.580
<i>I'll definitely get you,</i>

00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:00.570
<i>and this time for sure, I won't let you go.</i>

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:05.450
Listen. If you get captured, the world 
and you, too, will be in big trouble.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.370
Even so, you still want to go?

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.330
We promised...

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:12.080
that we'll be together forever, so...

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:15.040
Okay, then. Let's go, Nessa!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.790
Roger!
